# Call Metrics

Track performance over time.

## Core Metrics

- Dial-to-connect rate
- Connect-to-right-person rate
- Right-person-to-conversation rate
- Conversation-to-15-minute-meeting rate
- 15-minute overview show rate
- 15-minute-to-60-minute briefing conversion rate
- 60-minute briefing show rate
- Referral rate
- Email-only outcome rate
- Soft-no recovery rate
- No-show rate

## Objection Metrics

Track frequency of:

- Send me an email
- No time
- Is there a fee?
- Is this pay-to-play?
- Why us?
- We do not share confidential information
- We already work with another analyst firm
- Talk to PR
- Talk to Analyst Relations
- Not the right person

## Coaching Rule

Do not judge performance based on one call.

Look for patterns across multiple calls.

Use metrics to identify whether the main issue is:

- contact data,
- opener,
- relevance,
- explanation,
- objection handling,
- meeting framing,
- scheduling,
- show rate.
